      "id": "at-glance",
      "title": "At a glance",
      "body": "For travelers, Cảm ơn is the phrase to keep ready for \"Thank you\" in small service and first-contact moments. Say this anytime someone helps you, serves you, or gives directions. A short thank-you keeps service moments warm and simple. It works best when you focus on using a short friendly phrase that invites a clear reply. The forms below help you choose the version that fits the person, setting, or level of politeness.",
